description_en:
This graph illustrates the cumulative number of alien species introduced in Belgium, based on their year of first observation as documented in the <a href="https://www.gbif.org/dataset/6d9e952f-948c-4483-9807-575348147c7e" target="_blank"> GRIIS checklist </a>.

<br>
<span style="color: red; font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold; animation: pulse 1s infinite;">!</span>

<style>
@keyframes pulse {
  0% { transform: scale(1); }
  50% { transform: scale(1.2); }
  100% { transform: scale(1); }
}
</style>

<i>At present, a bug causes the same alien species to be counted multiple times if observed in Flanders, Brussels, and Wallonia. We are actively working to resolve this issue as quickly as possible and apologize for any inconvenience it may cause.</i>
